<p>"What's in the current patch?" is the question that never goes away, and the answer changes every few weeks. So instead of a new post every time, this is the one page I keep current. Same link, new facts. Everything below comes from RSI's patch notes, status page and Release View, and each version links to the stories where we dug into the details. Starting out? The <a href="/star-citizen/beginners-guide/">beginner's guide</a> covers your first hours.</p>

