<div class="ver">
<h3 id="ptu-5-0">Alpha 5.0 <span class="stat ptu">PTU only</span></h3>
<p><b>What it is.</b> CIG renamed Alpha 4.11 to Alpha 5.0 on November 4, saying the number reflects "the significance of the new technologies and features coming together." It's the first release where the Genesis technologies come together, with <b>Nyx I</b> going first. Our <a href="/news/star-citizen-alpha-4-11-renamed-alpha-5-0-genesis-nyx-i/">rename story</a> has the full list.</p>
<p><b>Where it stands.</b> The latest PTU build is <b>13284307</b> (VERSION 5.0.0-PTU.13284307), pushed November 25 and open to all backers on the US-only PTU channel. Long Term Persistence is on, and RSI says a 50x reputation reward multiplier is active on the PTU. The test focus list: Genesis (Planet Tech V5), Nyx I, Starchitect points of interest, mission boards and local missions, intraplanetary server meshing, vehicle TTK balance, the missile lock interface update and VOIP reliability.</p>
<p><b>What CIG has committed for 5.0 (per RSI's Release View, as covered in our rename story).</b></p>
<ul>
  <li><b>Starchitect:</b> procedural, faction-owned ground locations built from modular tiles, plus a mission pack meant to keep players planetside longer.</li>
  <li><b>Planet Tech V5:</b> a rework of how planets are built, populated and rendered.</li>
  <li><b>Contract Boards:</b> Guild Halls at regional hubs where you browse contracts and build reputation with guilds.</li>
  <li><b>Population Manager and DGS Planet Subdivision:</b> server-side work to load balance populations and split planets into smaller server territories.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>Not 5.0:</b> Nyx II and Nyx III slid to Alpha 5.1, tentatively Q1 2027.</p>
<p><b>Unconfirmed, so take it with salt:</b> RSI hasn't said whether 5.0 comes with a wipe, and it hasn't given a Live date beyond Q4 2026. A list of subscriber perks (Centurion and Imperator) surfaced from the PTU files, and CIG's Big T-O answered on Spectrum that there are no plans to introduce them. Our <a href="/news/star-citizen-cig-no-plans-subscriber-perks-reputation-boost-claim-discount/">story on that</a> has the quote.</p>
