<div class="ver">
<h3 id="live-4-10-3">Alpha 4.10.3 <span class="stat">Live</span></h3>
<p><b>Live since November 12.</b> The launcher shows VERSION 4.10.3-LIVE.12650677. RSI's notes say Long Term Persistence is preserved and the starting aUEC is 20,000. Our <a href="/news/star-citizen-alpha-4-10-3-live-vanduul-incursion-galaxy-liberator-iae/">Live story</a> has the full rundown.</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>InterSec Defense Solutions missions.</b> A new contract line against the Vanduul in deep space around Nyx. Per CIG, most of it unlocks after the Vanduul Tech Smugglers work for Welcome to Nyx.</li>
  <li><b>LBCO Skarnov rifle.</b> A new FPS energy weapon whose shots chain electricity between targets.</li>
  <li><b>Salvage ship buffer increase.</b> Listed under gameplay in RSI's notes.</li>
  <li><b>New ships for aUEC in game.</b> RSI's post says the RSI Galaxy and Anvil Liberator are flyable now.</li>
  <li><b>Intergalactic Aerospace Expo.</b> IAE 2956 runs in New Babbage through November 27.</li>
  <li><b>129 issues closed,</b> including multiple exploits and 36 from Issue Council reports. Fourteen fixes aim squarely at hangar and ASOP terminal flow.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>Hotfixes since Live (from RSI's Hotfix Central).</b></p>
<ul>
  <li><b>Nov 19:</b> Client hotfix 13220821, with fixes for the top three client crashes, including the number one Vulkan crash. The hotfix channel is closed as of RSI's latest update.</li>
  <li><b>Nov 16:</b> Server (DGS) build 13165946 deployed without downtime, per RSI Status.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>How it got here.</b> 4.10.3 hit the PTU on October 24 for <a href="/news/star-citizen-alpha-4-10-3-ptu-wave-1-vanduul-incursion-skarnov-rifle/">Wave 1</a>, opened to <a href="/news/star-citizen-alpha-4-10-3-ptu-all-waves-13055118-vanduul-skarnov/">all waves</a> on October 30, then to <a href="/news/star-citizen-alpha-4-10-3-ptu-all-backers-13093654-hangar-overlap-prowler/">all backers</a> on November 3. It reached <a href="/news/star-citizen-4-10-3-ptu-rc1-13160301-release-candidate-iae/">Release Candidate</a> on November 11 and went Live the next day.</p>
</div>

