<p>RSI Status shows the Live deployment for 4.10.2 starting October 9, with servers offline at 1030 UTC. A critical hybrid-crash fix (build 12913470) went to the Live channel on October 13, and a further server-side hotfix (12939222) was being canary-tested on October 14. See our <a href="/news/star-citizen-alpha-4-10-2-hotfix-live/">4.10.2 hotfix story</a>.</p>
</div>

