<h2 id="faq">Quick answers</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>What version is Star Citizen Live right now?</b> Alpha 4.10.3, with client hotfix 13220821.</li>
  <li><b>Is 5.0 out?</b> Not on Live. It's on the PTU, and RSI's Release View lists it for Q4 2026.</li>
  <li><b>Will there be a wipe?</b> RSI hasn't said. 4.10.3 preserved Long Term Persistence.</li>
  <li><b>Where do I check live status?</b> <a href="https://status.robertsspaceindustries.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">RSI Status</a>.</li>
